        "cooked": "<p>And now: the PDF collection page is officially live! Go over to the link and you can download the full Deep Cuts!</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://frivyeti.itch.io/venture-comics-deep-cuts\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/e/edb0587e699e282143c5f269a44cf623f2fb2806.jpeg\" class=\"site-icon\" data-dominant-color=\"595656\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://frivyeti.itch.io/venture-comics-deep-cuts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">itch.io</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:631/500;\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/cdb8d629b647b0bd952b73c40567a5b46cd0a8b1.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" data-dominant-color=\"6A6664\" width=\"631\" height=\"500\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://frivyeti.itch.io/venture-comics-deep-cuts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Venture Comics: Deep Cuts by FrivYeti</a></h3>\n\n  <p>A sourcebook for the History of Venture Comics</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>I’ll be spending the week assembling links for the second thread, and then Friday we can begin with environments…</p>",
