        "created_at": "2026-05-22T16:41:22.633Z",
        "cooked": "<p>And for future archive-binging, the new thread is live! You can find it here:</p><aside class=\"quote quote-modified\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"32328\">\n  <div class=\"title\">\n    <div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/48/1919_2.png\" class=\"avatar\">\n    <a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/the-history-of-venture-comics-pt-2-places-to-go-supervillains-to-see/32328/2\">The History of Venture Comics, Pt. 2: Places to Go, Supervillains To See</a> <a class=\"badge-category__wrapper \" href=\"/c/games/sentinel-comics-rpg/26\"><span data-category-id=\"26\" style=\"--category-badge-color: #F7941D; --category-badge-text-color: #FFF; --parent-category-badge-color: #3AB54A;\" data-parent-category-id=\"73\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category --has-parent\" title=\"Discussions about the Sentinel Comics Role Playing Game\"><span class=\"badge-category__name\">Sentinel Comics RPG</span></span></a>\n  </div>\n  <blockquote>\n    Alright, here we go! \nStarting on Monday, we’re going to work our way chronologically through a whopping fifty-four environments, eight to ten for each age ranging from 1940 to 2026, because that’s the sort of person that I am. I’m once again using a homemade randomizer, although I reserve the right to put my finger on the scales whenever there’s a particular Venture Comics event I want to run. \nMy randomizer uses a set of rolls of d8s, d10s, d12s, and d20s, in three stages. \nFirst, roll 2d8 and…\n  </blockquote>\n</aside>\n",
